    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/18/Rayana_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250303133103\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Rayana Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/18/Rayana_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250303133103\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"949\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Rayana Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Rayana_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eRadiant sword of Aurora\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA twisted sword wielding Beautiful Warrior. As her dignified appareance suggest, she maneuvers blades of light with her magnificient swordmanship to have her enemies at her mercado.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/34/Rayana_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250303133105\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Rayana S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/34/Rayana_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250303133105\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1027\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Rayana S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Rayana_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u0